{"synopsis":"Dewa menciptakan Abyss untuk menghilangkan kebosanannya\nTerperangkap di jurang maut yang mengerikan umat manusia berada di jalan menuju kiamat\nApakah ini sudah berakhir bagi kita sekarang\nDi ambang kehancuran umat manusia empat orang terkuat yang selamat mencoba mencegahnya dengan melakukan perjalanan kembali ke masa lalu ke titik tepat sebelum umat manusia ditarik ke dalam jurang maut Tapi hanya satu dari mereka yang bisa kembali ke masa lalu Apa yang perlu dipikirkan Bukankah sudah diputuskan siapa yang akan pergi Yang terkuat di antara kita Kang Hansoo Ini adalah kisah kehidupan orang kuat yang legendaris Kang Hansoo yang kembali demi menyelamatkan umat manusia dari kehancuran Akankah dia bisa menyelamatkan semua orang","alternative_title":"환생좌","author":"ALLA, Gaetganggu, Mangdungyi","artist":"On the Rock","chapters":[{"number":"86","chapter":"86","slug":"6a9b0a93-8a9a-4692-b575-40908324f585","date":"2026-06-11","images":[]},{"number":"85","chapter":"85","slug":"b327b0f1-64e1-4aa5-896e-7b0946403862","date":"2026-05-28","images":[]},{"number":"84","chapter":"84","slug":"a03796aa-0fee-4488-b1c3-143d289050c5","date":"2026-05-17","images":[]},{"number":"83","chapter":"83","slug":"b4e777c7-5c13-4aba-bb21-6c4e9cfc3368","date":"2026-05-15","images":[]},{"number":"82","chapter":"82","slug":"d6b0163a-b9fe-426b-aeaa-9f20b0147dec","date":"2026-04-10","images":[]},{"number":"81","chapter":"81","slug":"9de0a7e7-322e-475f-a5b1-eb963d480526","date":"2026-03-25","images":[]},{"number":"80","chapter":"80","slug":"5b47542c-0aa7-4ff7-987f-6f03299ff2d0","date":"2026-03-10","images":[]},{"number":"79","chapter":"79","slug":"3df4df6c-063b-4a56-ac8a-6166942620f0","date":"2025-05-07","images":[]},{"number":"78","chapter":"78","slug":"6aacf850-51a4-49ba-bc9e-b942cc3c3432","date":"2025-05-05","images":[]},{"number":"77","chapter":"77","slug":"b8334b49-5f1a-4557-aaf6-9011d3756ed4","date":"2025-04-22","images":[]},{"number":"76","chapter":"76","slug":"327ba26f-7ba3-4ed3-9af